Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}本字幕來源互聯網  原製作者： 漫游字幕组
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.00,0:00:10.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}感謝字幕組及製作字幕個人的辛勤勞動與付出
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.00,0:00:15.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}字幕由kewenyu重新製作以適應重製版
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.20,0:01:01.52,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這裡…好可怕
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.19,0:01:05.61,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,保護我…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.90,0:01:07.70,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.46,0:01:11.25,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,保護…史黛拉…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.24,0:01:14.75,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,史黛拉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.60,0:01:16.25,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,史黛拉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.03,0:01:21.03,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真…喜歡…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.29,0:01:25.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,史黛拉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.36,0:01:35.56,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事了 史黛拉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.03,0:01:49.38,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,已經不用…再害怕任何東西了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.87,0:01:53.24,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,也不用再痛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.68,0:01:58.27,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所以…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.10,0:02:16.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,已經…沒有任何東西能傷害你了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.63,0:02:21.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不會再有任何人欺負你了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.27,0:02:32.94,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所以…安心吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.27,0:02:36.21,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,靜靜地…在這裡…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.64,0:02:42.45,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,安息吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.29,0:02:53.68,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,說了要保護你的…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.54,0:02:57.94,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我…說了要保護你的…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.05,0:03:02.83,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,史黛拉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.90,0:03:04.73,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,僕たちは迷いながら
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,たどり着く場所を探しつづけ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,悲しくて涙流しても
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,いつか輝きにかえて
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,閉ざした過去が今
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,胸を搖さぶるから
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,求めるほど遠く
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,置き去りの心
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,僕らは生きるほど何かを失って
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,それでも明日への
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,夢を捨てたくない
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,悲しみの理由でさえも
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,つよく抱きしめていたい
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,通りすぎた季節のその先に
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,なにがあるのだろう
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,僕たちは迷いながら
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,たどり着く場所を探しつづけ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,悲しくて涙流しても
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,いつか輝きにかえて
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Couse I never do not stopping my dream!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.46,0:05:07.00,Title SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(350,350)}{\blur6}眼前的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.09,0:05:07.58,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,快挖新的洞
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.81,0:05:09.55,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,身份不明的屍體都處理掉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.65,0:05:12.01,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,防毒面具送來了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.01,0:05:15.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.57,0:05:17.56,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,過來這邊 知道吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.24,0:05:21.76,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不分發消毒劑會很糟糕
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.01,0:05:23.69,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不能用槍 牆會崩塌
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.00,0:05:26.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,有人認識這孩子的父母嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.04,0:05:28.57,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,還活著 幫我一把
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.36,0:05:31.47,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不過 這可真慘啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.95,0:05:33.98,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,地球軍太胡來了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.69,0:05:35.75,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.57,0:05:39.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,在迪奧基亞時
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.21,0:05:43.38,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,議長也說過「我們這到底是在幹什麼呢」
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.40,0:05:44.95,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,確實
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.09,0:05:52.03,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,說實話 也想過重複這樣的戰鬥到底有什麼用
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.54,0:05:56.44,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雖說絕不重蹈上次大戰的覆轍
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.97,0:05:59.37,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,單純和自然人融合
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.56,0:06:01.52,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,議長的想法是不錯
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.81,0:06:08.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 該打的是不是趕快打完比較好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.22,0:06:13.38,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,否則這場戰爭不知道要拖到什麼時候
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.21,0:06:16.70,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,或許是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.90,0:06:25.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真 能進來嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.86,0:06:30.03,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,在幹什麼?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.99,0:06:32.47,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真 是阿斯蘭
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.48,0:06:33.93,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.75,0:06:35.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,哦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.08,0:06:39.69,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Freedom
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.85,0:06:43.70,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡 怎麼會這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.20,0:06:48.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,攝影機前的反應快得驚人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.58,0:06:50.48,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,推進器的操作也完美無瑕
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.96,0:06:53.25,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,隨心所欲地操縱著機體
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.73,0:06:57.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Freedom的能量在Impulse之上
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.95,0:06:59.86,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,還能操縱到這種地步
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.11,0:07:02.78,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真 雷  你們在幹什麼?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.96,0:07:07.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,幹什麼? 如你所見
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.59,0:07:10.81,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,在模擬和Freedom的戰鬥啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.56,0:07:12.90,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,到底有什麼事?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.08,0:07:15.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼要做這種事
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.09,0:07:17.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,因為他很強
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.74,0:07:24.01,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,據我所知 現在MS中最強的就是它
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.64,0:07:27.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,連那架Destroy都打倒了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.18,0:07:32.47,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼以之為對手進行訓練 不是好事嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.76,0:07:34.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,如果有什麼萬一
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.33,0:07:38.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,ZAFT裡若沒有人能應付他可不太妙吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.28,0:07:41.47,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這個完全不知底細的傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.92,0:07:42.48,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.91,0:07:44.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,幹什麼?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.91,0:07:49.42,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.05,0:07:50.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真也收歛點
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.67,0:07:56.42,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭 我認為真說得沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.61,0:07:58.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Freedom很強
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.64,0:08:01.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,而且雖然不知其意圖
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.35,0:08:03.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,他並不屬於我們軍隊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.73,0:08:06.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真所說的事態很可能會發生
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.17,0:08:12.33,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,即使他曾與你並肩作戰
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.17,0:08:15.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 基拉不是敵人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.31,0:08:17.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.80,0:08:20.60,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,在達達尼爾攻擊了本艦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.20,0:08:23.08,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,海涅也是因他而被擊墜
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.41,0:08:27.18,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你不也被他擊落過嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.74,0:08:34.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然戰鬥的判斷是上頭的事
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.97,0:08:37.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但無法斷定那不是敵人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.82,0:08:41.70,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那我們就應該針對它做好準備
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.30,0:08:49.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可以的話 希望阿斯蘭也能以你的經驗給些建議
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.32,0:08:52.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,算了 雷
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.95,0:08:55.59,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,輸的經驗可沒什麼參考價值
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.78,0:08:56.47,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.76,0:08:57.78,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 阿斯蘭
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.97,0:09:01.23,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我會和真說的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.53,0:09:24.28,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Freedom
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.86,0:09:29.90,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,由我來打倒
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.75,0:09:48.10,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,還在睡嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.81,0:09:53.03,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,治療時醒過一次
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.89,0:09:57.68,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,自稱聯合軍第八十一獨立軌道軍所屬
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.36,0:10:01.48,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,尼歐 羅阿諾克上校
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.81,0:10:05.57,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 檢查出的身體數據
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.91,0:10:09.90,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,和這艘船資料庫中的那個人百分之百一致
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.04,0:10:13.72,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這個人是…穆 拉 佛拉卡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.73,0:10:18.71,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,或者說…肉體上是
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.26,0:10:22.38,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那到底是怎麼回事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.42,0:10:25.57,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,也就是說他是少校吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.66,0:10:29.39,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 雖然是那樣沒錯…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.27,0:10:33.87,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,哎呀 我什麼時候變成少校了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.01,0:10:38.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不是說了我是上校嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.97,0:10:41.61,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,別因為是俘虜 就隨便給我降級
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.46,0:11:04.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了 一見鍾情了嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.79,0:11:05.60,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,美女
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.23,0:11:10.90,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,穆先生
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.90,0:11:14.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,穆是誰啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.70,0:11:27.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,喪失記憶了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.81,0:11:30.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,說喪失…似乎不太一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.91,0:11:35.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,確實若不是這樣也不會在地球軍
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.51,0:11:39.92,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 那是穆先生
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.51,0:11:46.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所以 我…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.54,0:11:48.49,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,也是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.34,0:11:55.47,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不過喪失記憶…對艦長來說或許更殘酷
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.42,0:12:06.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,與其修理不如更換
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.75,0:12:09.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,直接拿新貨來最快了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.42,0:12:12.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不過Zaku暫且不說 Saviour就麻煩了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.74,0:12:14.62,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼 還有?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.68,0:12:17.10,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不過這可能是最後的了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.61,0:12:19.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,已經亂七八糟了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.24,0:12:25.04,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,據我所知 現在MS中最強的就是它
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.77,0:12:26.95,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,如果有什麼萬一
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.31,0:12:30.23,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,ZAFT裡若沒有人能應付他可不太妙吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.28,0:12:31.90,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.49,0:12:35.92,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了 站在這種地方
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.84,0:12:37.32,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.43,0:12:43.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真 又被原諒了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.58,0:12:47.97,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,上次也沒被追究
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.25,0:12:50.97,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣看來倒也正常
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.66,0:12:54.08,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不過呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.37,0:12:55.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,就因為是超級王牌
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.52,0:12:58.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,幹什麼都能被原諒的話 總會有人不滿
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.97,0:13:01.43,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你看起來很不滿啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.85,0:13:05.15,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所以想讓我向艦長抱怨
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.48,0:13:07.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,要求有所表示嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.88,0:13:08.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.32,0:13:09.62,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不是啦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.95,0:13:15.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我只是希望阿斯蘭能再拿出些幹勁
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.14,0:13:18.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,多顯示一下你的能力
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.58,0:13:24.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣的話 真也會比較老實 比較好使喚
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.20,0:13:26.24,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,露娜瑪莉雅
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.02,0:13:28.92,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭太溫柔了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.82,0:13:32.18,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然我也喜歡這點
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.87,0:13:33.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,太吃虧了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.33,0:13:36.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,吃虧?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.82,0:13:41.71,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 難得擁有這樣的權限和能力
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.88,0:13:44.65,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,多按照自己的想法做吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.80,0:13:49.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,權限 能力
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.55,0:13:51.28,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 不是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.78,0:14:03.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,議長 可以了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.01,0:14:04.78,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 拜託了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.53,0:14:05.95,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,開始吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.23,0:14:09.66,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,3 2
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.56,0:14:16.61,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,各位 我是PLANT最高評議會議長
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.26,0:14:18.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,吉魯巴多 狄蘭達爾
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.54,0:14:24.49,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,因為我們PLANT與地球人們的戰爭尚未結束
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.12,0:14:29.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,請原諒突然發送這樣的訊息
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.10,0:14:34.03,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但衷心希望各位能用心傾聽
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.99,0:14:40.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,艦長 狄蘭達爾議長從PLANT發來緊急訊息
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.00,0:14:44.92,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,通過所有媒體向全世界發佈
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.01,0:14:49.39,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我希望大家現在能夠瞭解
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.98,0:14:52.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼 怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.66,0:14:54.87,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,狄蘭達爾議長
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.81,0:14:56.90,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,向全艦播放
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.72,0:14:59.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,指示乘員盡可能收聽
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.01,0:15:00.48,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.36,0:15:14.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.64,0:15:16.71,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.13,0:15:19.56,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}至今為止戰火卻不斷蔓延的原因
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.07,0:15:20.95,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.44,0:15:25.28,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}說到底 這場戰爭發生的真正原因
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.43,0:15:23.22,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,據說是議長的緊急訊息
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.53,0:15:29.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,由於各國收集的情報不同
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.87,0:15:32.40,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,想必許多人至今仍不得而知
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.78,0:15:44.59,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,騙人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.20,0:15:46.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼玩意
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.55,0:15:48.32,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,怪獸
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.68,0:15:49.62,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這是前些日子
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.13,0:15:57.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,聯合軍新型巨大兵器從歐亞大陸中央朝西部地區都市行進時的情況
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.99,0:15:58.90,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.67,0:16:01.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這台巨型毀滅武器
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.54,0:16:02.92,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,在無任何警告的情況下
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.11,0:16:04.49,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,突然開始攻擊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.17,0:16:09.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}避難不及的居民連同城市一起被化為灰燼
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.45,0:16:09.90,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阻止他 屏蔽信號 快
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.70,0:16:15.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們立刻進行了阻擊與防禦戰
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.90,0:16:20.67,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,遺憾的是 付出了重大的犧牲
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.47,0:16:26.57,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,始作俑者是地球軍 被燒焦的是地球的土地
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.77,0:16:29.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為何做這種事
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.62,0:16:35.51,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,聯合的目的難道不是解放ZAFT支配的地區嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.75,0:16:38.37,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這能稱之為解放嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.46,0:16:42.50,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這種將居民和土地一起化為灰燼的行為
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.78,0:16:47.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我軍的確對聯合軍的所作所為抱有不同意見
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.15,0:16:50.69,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,對退出其同盟的歐亞各國
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.02,0:16:52.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,以及欲實現獨立的人們
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.50,0:16:55.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,從人道立場上一直進行支援
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.35,0:16:58.81,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,希望眼下這種毫無益處
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.47,0:17:01.75,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,終日戰爭的生活畫上休止符
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.47,0:17:05.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,希望找回自己安逸平和的生活
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.97,0:17:06.51,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,史黛拉
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.56,0:17:08.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,希望不用奔赴戰場
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.50,0:17:11.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,能與愛人朝夕相伴
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.70,0:17:15.63,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們對抱有這種願望的人進行了支援
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.27,0:17:19.57,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,媽媽 媽媽
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.81,0:17:23.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那個聯合軍的怪物把一切都燒光了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.08,0:17:25.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,敵人是聯合軍
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.88,0:17:27.48,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們被ZAFT所救
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.97,0:17:29.99,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,認為是假的話 親眼來看看
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.05,0:17:34.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但我們希望和平的舉動一再被無視
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.69,0:17:43.03,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,對選擇對話解決問題的歐亞西部地區的人們
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.46,0:17:44.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,聯合軍以背叛為罪名
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.08,0:17:47.11,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不由分說進行殺戮
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.55,0:17:48.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,還包括了小孩
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.84,0:17:50.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阻止他 在幹什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.19,0:17:53.57,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,快讓他停下來
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.06,0:17:57.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,吉普利爾 這是怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.59,0:17:59.78,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這是你的責任問題
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.20,0:18:03.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,狄蘭達爾到底想幹什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.83,0:18:16.21,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Freedom…不見了…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.46,0:18:22.10,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.85,0:18:24.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為何要做出這樣的事
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.43,0:18:26.63,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,和平就不能被饒恕嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.19,0:18:28.64,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,戰爭就一定要繼續嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.20,0:18:31.38,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是誰? 為何說這種話?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.01,0:18:34.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼我們就不能牽起手來
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.44,0:18:39.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這次戰爭
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.27,0:18:46.75,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,的確是因我們協調者中一小部分人引發的浩劫開始
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.48,0:18:48.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是拉克絲小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.47,0:18:50.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,未能阻止它的發生
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.47,0:18:53.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,和它引發的眾多悲劇
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.02,0:18:55.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們也絕不會忘記
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.00,0:19:00.66,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,各位受災群眾的痛苦與悲傷
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.11,0:19:02.50,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,現在一定仍難以散去
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.47,0:19:10.27,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,也許由此引發新的戰爭也是難以避免的事
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.90,0:19:15.11,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 絕不能這樣下去
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.79,0:19:17.52,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這種整日互相傷害的世界中
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.87,0:19:19.18,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不會有安寧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.11,0:19:22.65,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那種無盡持續下去的仇恨連鎖反應
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.50,0:19:26.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們難道體驗得還不夠嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.40,0:19:33.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,請抹去籠罩眼眸的淚水後 向前看
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.24,0:19:38.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,發出悲傷的呼喊後 請聽一下對方的話語
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.67,0:19:45.39,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,讓我們回到那充滿溫暖人情的世界吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.80,0:19:51.67,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這應該也是我們所有人真正的願望
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.47,0:19:55.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,拉克絲小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.65,0:20:00.45,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但卻有人無論如何都要阻礙這一切實現
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.30,0:20:03.04,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,而且是從很久以前開始
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.33,0:20:07.70,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,讓人為了自己的利益戰鬥 再戰鬥
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.69,0:20:10.44,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不戰鬥的人是懦弱
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.91,0:20:12.49,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不遵從的人是背叛
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.97,0:20:14.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣呼籲著
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.30,0:20:16.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,總讓我們手持武器
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.52,0:20:17.62,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,樹立敵人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.99,0:20:19.94,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,指使我們開槍的人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.49,0:20:23.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,希望這個世界永無寧日的人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.13,0:20:28.81,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,顯然這次歐亞西部地區的慘狀也是他們一手造就
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.52,0:20:30.32,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,吉普利爾
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.72,0:20:31.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,讓他們停止
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.18,0:20:33.83,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,現在馬上讓他們停止
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.17,0:20:34.99,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼做不到
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.01,0:20:40.57,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那個認為協調者絕對是危險存在的Blue Cosmos
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.22,0:20:45.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,也是他們建立的組織 大家知道嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.98,0:20:49.64,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,背後的他們
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.83,0:20:52.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,總是熱衷於製造敵人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.36,0:20:57.62,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,熱衷於為世界帶來戰爭的軍事產業復合體
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.08,0:21:00.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,死之商人 Logos
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.76,0:21:05.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,他們才是我們這些期盼和平的人們真正的敵人
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.91,0:21:09.98,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Logos是?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.34,0:21:15.97,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,議長
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.56,0:21:21.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我從心底盼望著不再發生戰爭的和平世界
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.42,0:21:25.86,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,因此 告訴那些欲加以阻撓的人
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.64,0:21:29.44,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,對於世界真正的敵人Logos
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.82,0:21:33.44,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我在此宣佈一日不滅其根本誓不罷休
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.80,0:21:38.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這可不得了了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.81,0:21:39.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,艦長
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.37,0:21:40.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,今でも氣付かないでしょう
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,この靜かな空に
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,いつでも思い出すけど
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,もうどこにももどれない
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,そしてずっと心で醒めて
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,そっと氣付いて
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,いつかきっとやさしさ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,見えてくるように
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,What's stopping me? I get stuck again
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Is it really OK? It's never OK for me
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,What's got into me? I get lost again
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Is it really OK? It's never going to be
